Subject: [PATCH 09864/11362] Induction diagnosis reports the cause it
 diagnosed (REQ-ARC-WMTE-6710)

`induction_skipped` is the field this project reads to answer "why was the
induced world model rejected". It could not answer it.

`execute_bounded_llm_reinduction` pre-set its outer `skipped` variable to
`no_reachable_plan_after_refinement` before any refinement round ran. Two sites
diagnosed a real cause and wrote it ONLY into the per-round record: the held-out
transition verification failure, and the selection-or-planning exception. Four
sibling sites in the same loop already wrote both, so this was not a different
design -- it was the same design, missed twice.

The result is a false report with the right shape. An attempt whose every round
failed DYNAMICS verification was reported to every caller under a PLANNING
label, which sends a reader to the planner instead of to the verifier. 9 of 18
skip records in the live corpus were that default. Both sites now set the outer
variable.

Two supporting gaps closed with it:

- The proposer's per-channel character counters had no consumer inside the
  refinement loop, so they accumulated and died. Each round now records its own
  `channel_chars` by differencing two monotone reads, via
  `_channel_totals_snapshot` / `_channel_totals_delta`. "Where do the decoded
  tokens go" becomes a measurement rather than an inference. Characters, not
  tokens: a per-channel token count needs a tokenizer call the request never
  made. Raw text is never persisted.
- The chat channel-split accumulation moved out of the request method into
  `LocalGGUFProposer._record_chat_channel_split`, so it lives and is tested in
  one place.

Everything here is observation only. Nothing branches on any new field.

TESTS. tests/python/test_arc_induction_diagnosis_6710.py, 10 tests, covering
SCENARIO-ARC-WMTE-6710-1..7. The regression test named for the incident input is
test_all_rounds_failing_heldout_verification_is_not_reported_as_a_planning_failure:
every round fails held-out verification, and the attempt must not report a
planning label.

MUTATION PROOFS. Seven mutations, each RED on deletion, each restored and
